      "solution": "$\\frac{1}{3}\\ln 64 + 2\\ln 2 = \\ln(64^{\\frac{1}{3}}) + \\ln(2^2) = \\ln 4 + \\ln 4 = 2\\ln 4 = \\ln(4^2) = \\ln 16$",
      "ai_explanation": {
        "concept_rule": "Power law $k\\ln a = \\ln(a^k)$ and product law $\\ln a + \\ln b = \\ln(ab)$.",
